      "DEBBIE: Maybe this wasn't such a good idea.\nCHRIS: How about you two? You coming?",
      "CHRIS: What are they saying?\nDEBBIE: I don't know. I flunked Spanish.\nVERA: Hi everybody, what're you looking at. Let's go.\nCHRIS: Is everything okay?",
      "CHRIS: We could've been there already... ...if some people didn't have to go to the bathroom every five minutes.\nDEBBIE: Oh yeah...well just hope that you never get pregnant, 'cause all you do all the time is piss!",
      "CHILI: I can't think of anything.\nVERA: Sure, why not.\nVERA: Is this stuff any good?",
      "VERA: Better hide that grass. It's the cops.\nCHRIS: Oh, no."
    ]
